<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/587221ef16ad> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Here’s What Happens When Your Lawyer Uses ChatGPT" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2800" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/59ee064f7aa2> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "In his written statement, Mr Schwartz clarified that Mr LoDuca had not been part of the research and had no knowledge of how it had been carried out." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2823" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/5a842a5718ee> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "OpenAI's popular chatbot had \"hallucinated\" — a term for when artificial intelligence systems simply invent false information — and spat out cases and arguments that were entirely fiction." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2821" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/5c18a0110bff> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Federal Judge Kevin Castel is considering punishments for Schwartz and his associates." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2811" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/5da44152b4b9> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Lawyer Uses ChatGPT In Federal Court And It Goes Horribly Wrong" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2801" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/5e3c3869010d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[2810] Lawyer Steven A. Schwartz admitted in an affidavit that he had used OpenAI’s chatbot for his research." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2810" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/5eb970c6382d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "In a subsequent affidavit, Schwartz said that he had never used ChatGPT before so was \"unaware of the possibility that its content could be false\" telling Judge Kevin Castel that he \"deeply regrets\" using the AI tool." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3315" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/606c062ee726> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Schwartz, of the firm Levidow, Levidow & Oberman, apologized last week in an affidavit after being called out by the case's judge, saying he used 'a source that has revealed itself to be unreliable.'" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2833" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/612ebd0bd640> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "In an affidavit filed Thursday, fellow attorney Peter Loduca said he “had no reason to doubt the sincerity” of Schwartz’s research and that he had no role in the research." ;
